CI integration: write a GitHub Actions workflow that runs the android-doctor action

Usage: android-doctor ci [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  install  Write .github/workflows/android-doctor.yml, pinned to this version, running on pull requests
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --no-color  Never emit colour, even on a terminal (also honours the NO_COLOR environment variable)
  -h, --help      Print help
